title: Fourteen folders deep, four hundred files, and names longer than a panel is wide
folders: deep-tree, many-files, long-names

wait 4500
left files
tab 1
wait 900
fit
wait 1200
mark all-three
wait 500
goto d00/d01/d02/d03/d04/d05/d06/d07/d08/d09/d10/d11/d12/d13/file_13.rs
wait 1800
mark deepest
wait 500
tab 2
wait 1200
goto mod_07
wait 1500
mark many-folder
wait 500
collapse-all
wait 1200
mark many-collapsed
wait 500
expand-all
wait 1200
tab 3
wait 1200
goto short.rs
wait 1500
mark long-names
wait 500
right symbols
select s
wait 900
mark long-names-symbols
wait 500
left search
search fn
wait 1200
mark long-names-search
wait 500
quick a_very
wait 800
mark long-names-quick
wait 500
ui click 900 800
wait 300
left changes
wait 800
mark long-names-changes
wait 500
resize 720 420
wait 900
left files
wait 700
mark long-names-small
wait 500
quit
